{"title":"Career Roadmap: Poultry Manager","role":"Poultry Manager","summary":"Career Domain: Agriculture, Food & Life Sciences · Qualification Pathway: B.Sc – Dairy / Animal Husbandry / Poultry Science · Target Career: Poultry Manager","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc (Hons) Agriculture and Allied","Course":"Dairy / Animal Husbandry / Poultry Science"},"about":[{"label":"About this roadmap","text":"This roadmap was drafted with AI assistance from OneGrasp's related roadmaps and is awaiting expert review. Check fees, dates, eligibility and exam patterns on the official websites before you rely on them."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Poultry Manager runs poultry farms or units - broilers, layers or hatcheries - managing birds' health, feed, biosecurity, staff and production targets."},{"type":"h","text":"What a Poultry Manager does"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Plan placements, feeding and vaccination"},{"text":"Maintain biosecurity and farm hygiene"},{"text":"Track growth, egg production and mortality"},{"text":"Manage staff, costs and sales"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Where they work:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Integrated poultry companies"},{"text":"Hatcheries"},{"text":"Feed companies"},{"text":"Own poultry farm"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career stage","Typical role"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry-level"},{"text":"Farm Supervisor"}],[{"text":"Early career"},{"text":"Poultry Manager"}],[{"text":"Mid-level"},{"text":"Area Manager"}],[{"text":"Senior"},{"text":"Regional Head"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Own poultry business"}]]}]},{"heading":"Year-by-Year Learning Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1: Basics"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Animal science and poultry biology"},{"text":"Visit broiler and layer farms"},{"text":"Learn record-keeping"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2: Poultry management"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Poultry nutrition and housing"},{"text":"Diseases and vaccination"},{"text":"Biosecurity"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3: Experience"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Intern with a poultry integrator"},{"text":"Learn FCR and production economics"},{"text":"Learn hatchery basics"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4: Prepare to manage"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"RAWE / ELP on a poultry unit"},{"text":"Write a farm plan with costs"},{"text":"Apply to poultry companies"}]}]},{"heading":"Essential Skills","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Type"],"rows":[[{"text":"Poultry husbandry"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Biosecurity"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Production economics (FCR)"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Disease prevention"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Discipline"},{"text":"Professional"}],[{"text":"Team management"},{"text":"Professional"}],[{"text":"Quick decisions"},{"text":"Professional"}]]}]},{"heading":"Tools and Technologies to Learn","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Farm management software"},{"text":"Environment controllers"},{"text":"Excel"}]}]},{"heading":"Internships and Practical Experience","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Poultry integrators"},{"text":"Hatcheries"},{"text":"CARI Izatnagar"}]}]},{"heading":"Certifications and Additional Training","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Poultry management training (CARI / state institutes)"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Before you enrol","text":"Check the current syllabus, fees and eligibility on the certifying body's official website."}]},{"heading":"Higher Education Options in India","kind":"pg_india","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"Options after your degree:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"M.Sc Poultry Science (where eligible)"},{"text":"MBA Agri-Business"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Entrance exams and tests to know:"},{"type":"list","items"